# =========================
# MonoGame Specific
# =========================
# The Content Pipeline (MGCB) generates its own bin and obj folders 
# which are caught by the .NET rules below, but it's good practice 
# to explicitly ignore compiled .xnb files if they leak outside those folders.
*.xnb

